# Vercel CLI deploys upload from the repo root before applying the
# dashboard's configured Root Directory (apps/web), so anything gitignored
# for size/secrets reasons still needs excluding here too, or a local
# `vercel deploy` tries to upload it and fails (or worse, succeeds).

# ── Local-only reference trees (contain live secrets + family data) ────────
# Multiple GB each; never uploaded anywhere, per .gitignore's own comment.
homa-macmini/
homa-research/
homa-template/

# ── Never upload ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.turbo/
.eve/
.workflow-data/
